# --- Secrets hygiene (added after a .env.bak leak held a live S2S secret) ---
# Ignore EVERY env variant (.env, .env.bak, .env.local, .env.prod...) and only
# ever track *.example templates. gitleaks (CI + pre-commit) is the backstop.
.env*
!.env*.example
